From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:38:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: apple,nco: Add the S8000

The A9's NCO is the T8010's block at the same address with the same
channel stride (the ADT's pmgr-nco-page-size is 0x4000 on both), so it
falls back to apple,t8010-nco.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
index a23660034..d8915d404 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,nco.yaml
@@ -22,6 +22,9 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - const: apple,t7001-nco
       - const: apple,t8010-nco
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,s8000-nco
+          - const: apple,t8010-nco
       - items:
           - const: apple,t6020-nco
           - const: apple,t8103-nco
